sequenceDiagram
    participant Ext as Form externo
    participant N as Nginx
    participant API as Backend Node
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant BR as Brevo

    Ext->>N: POST /testeo_crm/api/leads/<br/>webhooks/psiko-aprende<br/>X-API-Key: whk_psiko_...
    N->>API: Proxy a localhost:3002
    API->>API: valida api_key del proyecto
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: SELECT project_queue_state<br/>FOR UPDATE
    API->>DB: SELECT gestores activos
    API->>DB: INSERT leads<br/>(responsable_id = gestor[next_index])
    API->>DB: UPDATE next_index = (next+1) % count
    API->>DB: INSERT lead_utms
    API->>DB: detecta duplicado por email<br/>marca reincidente si mismo producto
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>Ext: 200 {success, lead_id}<br/>menos de 500ms
    API-)BR: async sendLeadAssignedEmail
